   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "2\u20133 real options; the current proposal is only one of them",
   "originalText": "2\u20133 real options; the current proposal is only one of them",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "adr-optA",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 529.0,
   "width": 480,
   "height": 374,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 906774906,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1147120939,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "adr-optA-text"
    }
   ],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "adr-optA-text",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 46,
   "y": 535.0,
   "width": 468,
   "height": 340.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1223882990,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 534443558,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A. A schema per source\n\nHow it works: keep ctis.*, add ctgov.*, pubmed.*,\nmanual.*, gold.<dataset>_*; checks and scoring join\nacross them.\n\nPros:\n\u2022 no redesign now\n\u2022 each source keeps its own shape\n\nCons:\n\u2022 every check, page and score grows a branch per\n   source\n\u2022 duplicates across sources stay invisible\n\u2022 each gold dataset needs its own scoring code\n\nMark (current state)",
   "originalText": "A. A schema per source\n\nHow it works: keep ctis.*, add ctgov.*, pubmed.*,\nmanual.*, gold.<dataset>_*; checks and scoring join\nacross them.\n\nPros:\n\u2022 no redesign now\n\u2022 each source keeps its own shape\n\nCons:\n\u2022 every check, page and score grows a branch per\n   source\n\u2022 duplicates across sources stay invisible\n\u2022 each gold dataset needs its own scoring code\n\nMark (current state)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "adr-optA",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "adr-optB",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 550,
   "y": 529.0,
   "width": 480,
   "height": 374,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 272561091,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2070180323,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "adr-optB-text"
    }
   ],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "adr-optB-text",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 556,
   "y": 535.0,
   "width": 468,
   "height": 360.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2076654212,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 380182330,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "B. Central model + source adapters\n\nHow it works: central trial, document and gold\ntables; one adapter per source fills them; sources\nkeep their raw records beside them; Postgres writes\nan audit log.\n\nPros:\n\u2022 checks, pages and scoring see one shape\n\u2022 identity and duplicates handled once\n\u2022 a new source or gold set is an adapter, not a\n   rewrite\n\nCons:\n\u2022 a schema rebuild now\n\u2022 identity matching must be designed carefully\n\nMark (proposal)",
   "originalText": "B. Central model + source adapters\n\nHow it works: central trial, document and gold\ntables; one adapter per source fills them; sources\nkeep their raw records beside them; Postgres writes\nan audit log.\n\nPros:\n\u2022 checks, pages and scoring see one shape\n\u2022 identity and duplicates handled once\n\u2022 a new source or gold set is an adapter, not a\n   rewrite\n\nCons:\n\u2022 a schema rebuild now\n\u2022 identity matching must be designed carefully\n\nMark (proposal)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "adr-optB",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "adr-optC",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1060,
   "y": 529.0,
   "width": 480,
   "height": 374,
