   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Easier: adding a registry, publications or manual entry (an adapter); a new or\nlarger gold dataset (a converter + its evidence scope); fair evaluation; seeing\nwho added what; CI on fixed inputs; manual judgements next to automatic ones.",
   "originalText": "Easier: adding a registry, publications or manual entry (an adapter); a new or\nlarger gold dataset (a converter + its evidence scope); fair evaluation; seeing\nwho added what; CI on fixed inputs; manual judgements next to automatic ones.",
