   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Harder: one schema rebuild now and a local database reset; identity matching\nneeds care and a person for conflicts; bundles (~300 MB of PDFs for Bruckner et\nal.) live outside git; every write path must set an actor.",
   "originalText": "Harder: one schema rebuild now and a local database reset; identity matching\nneeds care and a person for conflicts; bundles (~300 MB of PDFs for Bruckner et\nal.) live outside git; every write path must set an actor.",
